{"path":"eval/cases/comprehende-50/sources/pr.json","ref":"603bbf138873e1fab673ef73d0a8238cc225190a","side":"new","lines":[{"sha":"11108ceae77651c0215de73990b7a73c9211ee77","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1789268342,"line":1,"text":"{"},{"sha":"11108ceae77651c0215de73990b7a73c9211ee77","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1789268342,"line":2,"text":"  \"html_url\": \"https://github.com/matemolnar8/comprehende/pull/50\","},{"sha":"11108ceae77651c0215de73990b7a73c9211ee77","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1789268342,"line":3,"text":"  \"number\": 50,"},{"sha":"11108ceae77651c0215de73990b7a73c9211ee77","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1789268342,"line":4,"text":"  \"title\": \"Add an Export branch for uploading the report\","},{"sha":"11108ceae77651c0215de73990b7a73c9211ee77","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1789268342,"line":5,"text":"  \"body\": \"The skill now has a short Export section. The last workflow step is a branch: upload the report, and it exports a static site. Otherwise it serves the local UI. It does not do both.\\n\\nWhen opening a PR, agents export that review and publish the folder with VibeDrop (`npx -y @vibedrop/cli deploy \\\"$EXPORT_DIR\\\"`), then put the site URL in the PR body. The VibeDrop skill lives in `.agents/skills/vibedrop`.\\n\\nChecked against PR #49: https://5xdyym5j.vibedrop.site/\\n\\nPosted by [Cursor] [cursor-grok-4.6]\","},{"sha":"11108ceae77651c0215de73990b7a73c9211ee77","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1789268342,"line":6,"text":"  \"user\": {"},{"sha":"11108ceae77651c0215de73990b7a73c9211ee77","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1789268342,"line":7,"text":"    \"login\": \"matemolnar8\""},{"sha":"11108ceae77651c0215de73990b7a73c9211ee77","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1789268342,"line":8,"text":"  },"},{"sha":"11108ceae77651c0215de73990b7a73c9211ee77","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1789268342,"line":9,"text":"  \"merged_at\": \"2026-09-01T06:02:09Z\","},{"sha":"11108ceae77651c0215de73990b7a73c9211ee77"